_0010> identifies tangent spaces.\nHence in this case <MATH_0011>\nis a hull for <MATH_0012>, see\nRemark <REF_0004>.\nBy Theorem <REF_0005>\nwe can always find such a <MATH_0013> if <MATH_0014> is separable and\n<MATH_0015> is a predeformation category satisfying\n(S1), (S2), and <MATH_0016>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5d607ee5adef09adb8f70ff27560af21976a20536eaa7a59dc3b15a37514d27d", "unit_id": "tag:06IZ:statement"}
